@startuml
title Activity (Part 2 - Draft Rewrite) - Save Draft, Rewrite, and Submit

|Requester|
start
:Open Purchasing > Creation;
:Enter or update request data;
:Click Save Draft;

|System|
:Save request with status = draft;
:Keep draft in purchase-requests store;

|Requester|
:Open draft request later;
:Rewrite data (item/quantity/unit/justification);

if (Submit now?) then (Yes)
  :Click Submit;
  |System|
  if (Required fields complete?) then (Yes)
    :Update same localId record;
    :Request appears in Review list;
    :Flow ends for requester;
    stop
  else (No)
    |Requester|
    :Show validation message;
    :Continue editing draft;
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Keep as draft for later editing;
  stop
endif

@enduml
